WHAT IS NODE EXPORTER?
===============================================================================

Node Exporter is an Exporter used by Prometheus to collect Linux System Metrics.

It exposes Linux system metrics through an HTTP endpoint.

Prometheus periodically scrapes these metrics.

Default Port

9100

