===============================================================================
ADD NODE EXPORTER TO PROMETHEUS
===============================================================================

Edit

/etc/prometheus/prometheus.yml

Example

scrape_configs:

- job_name: "linux_servers"

  static_configs:

  - targets:

      - "192.168.198.172:9100"

      - "192.168.198.173:9100"

